                            During the reign of <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9430Tewodros">King Tewodros II</persName> the manuscript probably belonged
                            to the <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0101MadhaneAlam">library of the church of Madḫāne ʿĀlam, in Magdala</placeName> 
